cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use VORTEX in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "VORTEX Aneurysm: a DICOM-to-STL pipeline for cerebral aneurysm CFD"
abstract: >-
  VORTEX (Vascular Output & Real-time Thresholding EXtraction) is an open-source
  tool that processes angio-CT/angio-MR DICOM images into high-quality,
  watertight STL meshes ready for OpenFOAM rigid-wall CFD, FSI simulations, or
  3D printing of cerebral aneurysms.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Diogo
    family-names: Luz
    affiliation: "NOVA Medical School, Department of Anatomy"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-06-17"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Supperpt/VORTEX"
keywords:
  - cerebral aneurysm
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - CFD
  - DICOM
  - segmentation
  - VMTK
  - OpenFOAM
  - medical imaging
